{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "7c1d351c-eb29-4615-88b6-511f1cfb4c72",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "7dce9553-65bb-400b-9970-de7217fdd43d",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4000",
            "content": {
                "en": "Noema stands quietly on the opera stage, facing away from the bustling crowd below. Veris pushes through the crowd, trying to get a little closer to her.",
                "zh": "沈梦之静静地站在立戏台上，背对着台下熙熙攘攘的群众。何以真穿过人群，企图离她更近一点。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 100.66666412353516,
            "positionY": 100.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "ef7a85ff-8ea6-472d-a70d-4d5616465b44",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4001",
            "content": {
                "en": "Suddenly, a group of people surged forward and surrounded Veris completely. Without a word, they grabbed her limbs and lifted her into the air.",
                "zh": "突然，一群人簇拥了上来，把何以真团团围住！！他们不由分说地拽着何以真的四肢，把她抬了起来！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 460.0,
            "positionY": 104.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "aa321000-3620-41f7-be91-ef6e76cdaaf7",
                    "targetObjectName": "CameraShake",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level4-17Stage",
                    "componentTypeName": "CameraShake",
                    "methodName": "Shake",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                },
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "eb33593f-e78b-4a1f-8bca-7b35cf834d82",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager_4_17",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level4-17Stage",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager4_17",
                    "methodName": "PlayFourImagesMoveFade",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                },
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "b09dec6e-5377-44c4-866c-8622e4585265",
                    "targetObjectName": "PeopleSound",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level4-17Stage",
                    "componentTypeName": "AudioSource",
                    "methodName": "Play",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "5bc42491-6a0b-49fa-9e5b-04c7e3368433",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "ed1baf90-69f0-402f-959a-2683ad667ded",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4002",
            "content": {
                "en": "What are you doing!? Let me go!! Somebody, help! Noema! Noema!!",
                "zh": "（大惊）你们在干什么！？放开我！！来人，救命啊——梦之！梦之！！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 810.0,
            "positionY": 104.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "8a81ea3a-e566-4004-b204-6cf778cbe665",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "8e02c129-2d5d-46b2-8d16-b277fb388ebe",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4003",
            "content": {
                "en": "Noema seemed to hear the commotion. She lifted her head slightly, but did not turn around. Veris could not see her expression.",
                "zh": "沈梦之好像听到了动静，微微抬了一下头，却没有转过来。何以真看不见她的神情。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1172.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 108.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "0219ef40-be88-41c3-9e54-7459e2f127ea",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "ed1baf90-69f0-402f-959a-2683ad667ded",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4004",
            "content": {
                "en": "Put me down! What are you trying to do!? Somebody, call the police!!",
                "zh": "（奋力挣扎，却根本无法挣脱）快放我下来！你们到底要干什么！？来人啊，快报警！！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1518.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 104.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "aa321000-3620-41f7-be91-ef6e76cdaaf7",
                    "targetObjectName": "CameraShake",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level4-17Stage",
                    "componentTypeName": "CameraShake",
                    "methodName": "Shake",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "418da420-a56f-4e2c-9a7f-e8b3ba860a0b",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "a25fdffd-1f6e-4f61-bc8e-909c14221cf2",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4010",
            "content": {
                "en": "The ritual begins!!",
                "zh": "（把何以真放到了鼓面前，大喊道）仪——式——开——始——！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3566.0,
            "positionY": 102.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "eb33593f-e78b-4a1f-8bca-7b35cf834d82",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager_4_17",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level4-17Stage",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager4_17",
                    "methodName": "playCurtainAnim",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 2
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "40e31609-c0a9-403a-be78-7a4b1e53dba8",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "a25fdffd-1f6e-4f61-bc8e-909c14221cf2",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4005",
            "content": {
                "en": "Stop struggling! To become a vessel for our Lady XiMu is the highest honor!",
                "zh": "（死死控制住何以真不断扭动的肩膀）乱动什么！能成为我们喜母大人的容器，那可是至高无上的荣誉！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1838.0,
            "positionY": 104.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "aa321000-3620-41f7-be91-ef6e76cdaaf7",
                    "targetObjectName": "CameraShake",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level4-17Stage",
                    "componentTypeName": "CameraShake",
                    "methodName": "Shake",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "5be199e7-735f-4058-9af3-d9d87974aa2a",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "032e23aa-1c44-460f-8151-ed6d83b5348c",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4006",
            "content": {
                "en": "A vessel!? What do you mean, a vessel!? N-No, I won’t—",
                "zh": "（大骇）什么、容器！？？不、我才不——",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2210.0,
            "positionY": 104.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "987020d0-0e6a-4529-a308-816416c8e663",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "a25fdffd-1f6e-4f61-bc8e-909c14221cf2",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4007",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Pressing a wad of cloth over Veris’s mouth) Oh, our master’s dear friend, you really don’t know how lucky you are!",
                "zh": "（拿一团布捂住了何以真的嘴）哎，家主这位朋友啊，你可真是身在福中不知福！被命运选中之人，乖乖敲好你的鼓，和我们一起开启这极乐世界吧！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2548.0,
            "positionY": 104.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "c7ba4141-ed7b-429b-aac3-5c3ed3c4c6c7",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "304b16b6-57c2-4fa3-80f8-7ee82eeb3533",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4008",
            "content": {
                "en": "Bliss!! Bliss!! XiMu!! XiMu!! A blissful age, XiMu descends!!",
                "zh": "极乐！！极乐！！喜母！！喜母！！极乐盛世、喜母降临！！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2888.666748046875,
            "positionY": 102.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "aa321000-3620-41f7-be91-ef6e76cdaaf7",
                    "targetObjectName": "CameraShake",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level4-17Stage",
                    "componentTypeName": "CameraShake",
                    "methodName": "Shake",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "aa791047-6a9f-4dde-854f-0a9704c3ead2",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "7dce9553-65bb-400b-9970-de7217fdd43d",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4009",
            "content": {
                "en": "The more these people chant, the more excited they become, until their eyes are bloodshot with frenzy. Whatever powder was sprinkled on that cloth is making Veris’s mind start to blur.",
                "zh": "这些人越喊越兴奋，甚至亢奋得眼睛充血。那团布上面不知道撒了什么粉，让何以真开始变得有些迷离。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3226.0,
            "positionY": 102.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 1
        },
